Only the hono `GET /config` route is present in the project content, and it calls `loadConfig()` (used but never defined here) and `configSchema` (not defined). The route inspects `result.ok`: if truthy it returns `c.json(result.data, 200)`; otherwise `c.json(result.issues, 400)`. So the result union is shaped `{ ok: true, data } | { ok: false, issues }`. The export signatures for `configSchema` and `loadConfig` (parameters/return types) are not in the provided content.

